cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FITS Viewer"
abstract: >-
  A fast, interactive FITS file viewer for quickly inspecting and sorting
  astrophotography image sequences. Images are shown at full resolution with
  fast histogram normalisation and simple keyboard navigation, while the
  underlying image data is displayed unchanged.
